WEBVTT

00:00:03.020 --> 00:00:06.710
And so, we shall handle this matter by taking the actions we've discussed.

00:00:06.710 --> 00:00:07.860
Understood.

00:00:07.860 --> 00:00:10.680
Madam, what of this transaction?

00:00:10.680 --> 00:00:13.410
I shall decide once I have read it in detail.

00:00:13.410 --> 00:00:14.430
Understood.

00:00:15.580 --> 00:00:18.160
That will end today's meeting.

00:00:18.580 --> 00:00:20.130
Excuse us.

00:00:30.650 --> 00:00:31.280
Yes?

00:00:31.830 --> 00:00:33.750
Mana and the others have arrived.

00:00:36.380 --> 00:00:38.510
Ai, are you well?

00:00:42.850 --> 00:00:44.810
Makopi, what's wrong?

00:00:46.450 --> 00:00:48.610
I was thinking about my queen...

00:00:48.610 --> 00:00:49.930
Yeah...

00:00:49.930 --> 00:00:52.330
We have to find her soon.

00:00:52.330 --> 00:00:56.770
It'd be nice if we had a clue, no matter how small...

00:00:57.110 --> 00:00:58.580
A clue...

00:01:04.390 --> 00:01:05.280
That's right!

00:01:05.970 --> 00:01:08.150
My queen loved roses!

00:01:08.600 --> 00:01:09.980
Roses?

00:01:11.830 --> 00:01:16.190
Happy go lucky girls! Precure! Yeah!

00:01:16.190 --> 00:01:18.670
The world is like a merry-go-round

00:01:19.020 --> 00:01:21.540
Love makes it turn, 3, 2, 1

00:01:21.840 --> 00:01:23.580
Every day it sparkles

00:01:23.750 --> 00:01:27.280
Dokidoki Precure

00:01:28.750 --> 00:01:34.140
I wear my new clothes and walk a path I've never walked before

00:01:34.730 --> 00:01:39.810
My heart races and I greet the scenery around me

00:01:39.990 --> 00:01:45.440
The color of the flower on the corner will be my lucky color for the day

00:01:46.000 --> 00:01:50.910
Leave it all to me, because today I'm blessed

00:01:51.770 --> 00:01:56.590
If your friends are in trouble

00:01:56.810 --> 00:02:05.470
isn't it normal to help them?

00:02:05.470 --> 00:02:07.160
Happy lucky Precure

00:02:07.160 --> 00:02:09.560
Only Precure makes my heart pound

00:02:09.780 --> 00:02:12.380
Our happy love will change the world

00:02:12.660 --> 00:02:15.190
What's more than just cute

00:02:15.490 --> 00:02:19.070
is our promise between girls

00:02:19.870 --> 00:02:25.110
I will fight for you and believe in you

00:02:25.140 --> 00:02:31.010
Gather your unparalleled tenderness, yeah, Precure

00:02:35.880 --> 00:02:39.520
Well, knowing she likes roses isn't much...

00:02:40.870 --> 00:02:42.180
Speaking of roses,

00:02:42.540 --> 00:02:43.820
take a look.

