00:02:48.050 --> 00:02:51.680
A contest to find the best rose-loving lady.

00:02:52.080 --> 00:02:57.490
The victor shall be awarded the newly discovered Royal Yellow rose.

00:02:59.020 --> 00:03:01.050
That's my queen's favorite rose!

00:03:02.890 --> 00:03:06.360
But it only grew within the royal palace,

00:03:06.360 --> 00:03:08.370
so it shouldn't be in this world.

00:03:08.370 --> 00:03:09.870
What a mystery!

00:03:09.870 --> 00:03:14.570
So, shall we enter this contest and obtain the Royal Yellow ourselves?

00:03:15.580 --> 00:03:19.040
This rose may provide a clue to the queen.

00:03:19.040 --> 00:03:20.990
Great idea!

00:03:20.990 --> 00:03:23.140
You're a genius!

00:03:26.050 --> 00:03:30.650
We've Finally Found It?!

00:03:26.050 --> 00:03:30.650
We've Finally Found It?!

00:03:30.660 --> 00:03:33.130
Itsutsuboshi Rose Garden

00:03:35.180 --> 00:03:38.240
So the contest is being held at this garden?

00:03:38.240 --> 00:03:39.160
It's beautiful!

00:03:39.600 --> 00:03:43.110
Anyone who loves roses would come here, even the queen!

00:03:43.710 --> 00:03:45.970
Did someone call for me?

00:03:50.090 --> 00:03:54.540
Why yes, I've graced this garden with my royal beauty.

00:03:56.970 --> 00:03:57.710
Oh?

00:03:58.050 --> 00:03:59.930
So cute!

00:04:01.180 --> 00:04:05.260
Could she really be the queen?

00:04:05.260 --> 00:04:07.290
Hey, do you like roses?

00:04:07.290 --> 00:04:08.230
Roses?

00:04:08.900 --> 00:04:10.160
Hate 'em.

00:04:11.070 --> 00:04:12.490
I have no mercy...

00:04:12.490 --> 00:04:15.390
for things more beautiful than I.

00:04:20.860 --> 00:04:22.480
S-So?

00:04:22.480 --> 00:04:23.540
Probably not.

00:04:23.540 --> 00:04:25.240
Oh, that's cute!

00:04:27.850 --> 00:04:29.050
Give it to me.

00:04:29.050 --> 00:04:30.060
Huh?

00:04:30.060 --> 00:04:31.230
Huh?!

00:04:31.230 --> 00:04:33.600
Sorry, but I can't...

00:04:34.360 --> 00:04:36.190
Then will you trade it?

00:04:36.920 --> 00:04:38.880
For the fate of the world?

00:04:41.240 --> 00:04:42.710
Just a joke.

00:04:42.710 --> 00:04:43.930
I must be going.

00:04:43.930 --> 00:04:45.650
I need no farewell.

00:04:47.190 --> 00:04:49.500
What's <i>with</i> that girl?

00:04:51.430 --> 00:04:52.640
You're a moron.

00:04:53.220 --> 00:04:56.710
Why would you go into Beast Mode after what happened to Bel?

00:04:57.110 --> 00:04:59.790
Excuse <i>me</i> for wanting to beat the Precures.

00:04:59.790 --> 00:05:01.680
And <i>did</i> you beat them?

00:05:02.230 --> 00:05:03.010
Shut it!

00:05:03.010 --> 00:05:05.480
King Selfish's wrath is vicious.

00:05:07.330 --> 00:05:10.210
You don't have a choice either, Mammo.

00:05:10.210 --> 00:05:12.250
I don't need you to tell me that.

00:05:12.720 --> 00:05:15.300
Today will be the day I defeat the Precures.

00:05:15.300 --> 00:05:16.930
Beautifully...

00:05:16.930 --> 00:05:18.480
and mercilessly.

00:05:20.230 --> 00:05:22.800
Itsutsuboshi Rose Garden

00:05:20.540 --> 00:05:22.800
Thanks for waiting, ladies and gentlemen!

00:05:22.800 --> 00:05:26.000
The first stage of our Rose Lady Contest will be...

00:05:26.400 --> 00:05:27.970
the social dance!

00:05:27.970 --> 00:05:30.300
S-Social dance?

00:05:30.300 --> 00:05:32.570
I've never done that before...

00:05:38.420 --> 00:05:41.720
At first I thought a gaggle of chimps had gotten lost in the garden,

00:05:41.720 --> 00:05:43.690
but I see it's simply Alice's tagalongs.

00:05:44.520 --> 00:05:45.390
Chimps?

00:05:45.390 --> 00:05:49.530
Oh Lady Reina, calling them chimps is too cruel!

00:05:49.530 --> 00:05:50.550
Is it?

00:05:50.550 --> 00:05:53.370
Well, perhaps chimpanzees would be more palatable? {The pun is "saru-san -> saru-sama", but fuck that noise. Chimp is more informal than chimpanzee, so let's do that.}

00:05:53.370 --> 00:05:54.990
You're brilliant, Lady Reina!

00:05:54.990 --> 00:05:56.620
It fits perfectly!

00:06:00.710 --> 00:06:02.940
<i>When you talk like that to Alice, she'll...</i>

00:06:03.670 --> 00:06:07.450
<i>You will take back your insults to Mana...</i>

00:06:08.190 --> 00:06:09.730
<i>right this instant!</i>

00:06:10.790 --> 00:06:12.060
What is it?

00:06:12.060 --> 00:06:14.640
When Alice hears someone insulting her friends,

00:06:14.640 --> 00:06:16.450
she gets mad and loses control!

00:06:17.260 --> 00:06:18.850
Back in elementary school,

00:06:18.850 --> 00:06:22.190
she beat the pants off of some middle schoolers that were bullying Mana!

00:06:29.360 --> 00:06:32.600
Why Reina, you're as clever a jokester as ever.

00:06:35.630 --> 00:06:41.170
This is Itsutsuboshi Reina, the owner of this garden and an old friend.

00:06:41.820 --> 00:06:44.520
Less of a friend, more of a rival.

00:06:44.880 --> 00:06:47.900
From the family that forever one-ups the Yotsubas, {Kanji pun - Yotsuba = four leaves, Itsutsuboshi - five stars, and five is more than four. It's sadly impossible to translate without translating their names.}

00:06:47.900 --> 00:06:50.700
I am the rose of the Itsutsuboshis, {Slow down, this isn't Heartcatch.}

00:06:51.550 --> 00:06:53.600
Itsutsuboshi Reina!

00:06:55.820 --> 00:06:59.020
Might you be entering the contest as well?

00:06:59.020 --> 00:06:59.940
Why, yes.

00:06:59.940 --> 00:07:03.700
There are none more deserving of the title of Rose Lady than I.

00:07:04.980 --> 00:07:09.170
I take it by your "as well" that you are entering too?

00:07:09.170 --> 00:07:11.420
Yes. All four of us are.

00:07:14.180 --> 00:07:15.110
Hm?

00:07:15.110 --> 00:07:17.460
Are you not Kenzaki Makoto?

00:07:17.460 --> 00:07:18.320
I am.

00:07:18.320 --> 00:07:19.740
H-How underhanded!

00:07:19.740 --> 00:07:21.520
You're entering despite being an idol?

00:07:22.000 --> 00:07:22.490
Huh?

00:07:22.750 --> 00:07:27.410
You're abusing your celebrity status to draw the judges' attention!

00:07:27.410 --> 00:07:30.090
Yeah! You cheap, cowardly chimp!

00:07:31.300 --> 00:07:33.390
<i>I know </i>that<i> will get to her.</i>

00:07:34.930 --> 00:07:36.430
Hold on a moment.

00:07:36.430 --> 00:07:39.650
This contest searches for the best lady.

00:07:39.650 --> 00:07:44.030
Being an idol or not has no relevance.

00:07:44.030 --> 00:07:45.110
That's right!

00:07:46.360 --> 00:07:47.460
So be it.

00:07:47.460 --> 00:07:50.600
I shall defeat you with my own skill.

00:07:50.600 --> 00:07:51.680
We're off.

00:07:54.720 --> 00:07:55.950
Lady Reina,

00:07:55.950 --> 00:07:59.980
do you not think Alice will prove to be a difficult opponent?

00:07:59.980 --> 00:08:01.440
Worry not.

00:08:01.440 --> 00:08:06.830
If I insult or endanger her friends, she'll lose her temper and explode!

00:08:07.270 --> 00:08:09.700
She'll be instantly disqualified.

00:08:09.700 --> 00:08:13.880
So I'll have to step up my attacks to get through to her!

00:08:14.440 --> 00:08:15.360
Yes!

00:08:16.840 --> 00:08:16.880
Rose Lady Contest

