00:08:19.880 --> 00:08:22.750
<i>I've never done a social dance before...</i>

00:08:23.280 --> 00:08:25.120
<i>But I'm managing!</i>

00:08:25.120 --> 00:08:28.220
<i>My skills on stage are coming in handy!</i>

00:08:31.660 --> 00:08:33.180
What are you doing?

00:08:33.180 --> 00:08:34.290
Don't worry.

00:08:34.680 --> 00:08:37.230
We made a crack in her heel.

00:08:37.730 --> 00:08:39.040
A little more...

00:08:44.870 --> 00:08:46.330
Ow...

00:08:46.330 --> 00:08:47.280
Mana!

00:08:48.100 --> 00:08:48.710
Don't tell me...

00:08:50.600 --> 00:08:51.800
How clumsy!

00:08:51.800 --> 00:08:53.410
A clumsy chimp, at that!

00:08:59.140 --> 00:09:00.950
<i>Now, get angry. {Alt. "NOW, UNLEASH YOUR RAGE! SHOW ME THAT JACK IS BACK!"}</i>

00:09:02.220 --> 00:09:03.280
<i>I see!</i>

00:09:03.280 --> 00:09:06.420
<i>She did that on purpose to get Alice angry!</i>

00:09:07.260 --> 00:09:08.400
Don't worry!

00:09:08.400 --> 00:09:09.730
I can just do this!

00:09:11.500 --> 00:09:13.670
This'll make dancing easier.

00:09:13.670 --> 00:09:16.130
Now, let's get back to our dance.

00:09:16.910 --> 00:09:18.200
Mana!

00:09:19.370 --> 00:09:22.000
Our next stage will be painting!

00:09:22.000 --> 00:09:22.870
Now then,

00:09:23.220 --> 00:09:24.480
begin!

00:09:24.910 --> 00:09:25.940
Oh dear...

00:09:25.940 --> 00:09:31.750
So that Reina girl was trying to make Alice mad to disqualify her!

00:09:31.750 --> 00:09:34.640
I'm sure she has more tricks up her sleeve.

00:09:34.640 --> 00:09:36.960
I've finished, everyone!

00:09:39.140 --> 00:09:41.050
I'll be done soon.

00:09:49.400 --> 00:09:52.500
I <i>beg</i> your pardon, my hand slipped.

00:09:52.820 --> 00:09:55.470
There's not much you can do about that!

00:09:57.420 --> 00:09:59.710
Will you two just...

00:09:59.710 --> 00:10:01.870
You've made our paintings even better.

00:10:04.330 --> 00:10:07.650
Think of it as a Pollock-esque drip painting!

00:10:07.650 --> 00:10:08.670
Wow!

00:10:08.670 --> 00:10:10.260
Teach me how to do that!

00:10:10.260 --> 00:10:10.860
Certainly!

00:10:11.700 --> 00:10:13.490
<i>I'll get her next time!</i>

