00:12:37.330 --> 00:12:41.710
And if Alice takes the next point, she'll win!

00:12:50.600 --> 00:12:52.540
There was light in Alice's eyes!

00:12:52.540 --> 00:12:54.320
Something was shining over there!

00:12:54.320 --> 00:12:55.250
Let's go!

00:13:00.320 --> 00:13:01.310
There!

00:13:04.300 --> 00:13:05.130
So you came.

00:13:06.520 --> 00:13:09.100
Oops, our hands slipped!

00:13:11.280 --> 00:13:13.700
Clumsy, clumsy, clumsy!

00:13:13.700 --> 00:13:15.730
You chimps are covered in mud!

00:13:16.330 --> 00:13:18.680
<i>This'll have to make her mad!</i>

00:13:19.240 --> 00:13:21.210
<i>Come on, come on, come on!</i>

00:13:23.350 --> 00:13:25.240
Why aren't you mad?

00:13:26.720 --> 00:13:28.920
To protect my friends!

00:13:29.500 --> 00:13:32.320
Your friends aren't feeling very protected!

00:13:32.320 --> 00:13:33.560
So get mad!

00:13:34.160 --> 00:13:37.830
For some reason, I don't get mad anymore!

00:13:37.830 --> 00:13:39.730
But why?!

00:13:40.430 --> 00:13:41.560
I do not know...

00:13:42.750 --> 00:13:46.220
but if I changed somehow,

00:13:46.220 --> 00:13:49.000
it was thanks to my friends!

00:13:50.030 --> 00:13:51.380
Alice...

00:13:51.380 --> 00:13:55.210
What's so great about that mud-covered trash?!

00:13:58.020 --> 00:14:02.290
To me, they're the shiniest treasures I could ask for!

00:14:10.990 --> 00:14:11.930
Game!

00:14:12.390 --> 00:14:15.900
The winner is Yotsuba Alice!

00:14:15.900 --> 00:14:17.460
She did it!

00:14:17.460 --> 00:14:19.020
Brilliantly done.

00:14:21.670 --> 00:14:23.260
You useless curs!

00:14:23.260 --> 00:14:24.160
Get out of my sight!

00:14:24.160 --> 00:14:25.670
We're sorry!

00:14:27.030 --> 00:14:30.250
Alice didn't beat me on her own strength. {You can feel the salt pouring from her lips.}

00:14:31.000 --> 00:14:32.950
It was all because of her friends.

00:14:32.950 --> 00:14:35.930
Those friends of hers should just disappear!

00:14:39.170 --> 00:14:42.590
But in truth, I want friends too...

00:14:44.500 --> 00:14:48.250
Aw, why not make them disappear?

00:14:50.400 --> 00:14:52.600
I'll turn your desire into a dream come true.

00:14:52.600 --> 00:14:53.030
I'll turn your desire into a dream come true.

00:14:53.030 --> 00:14:53.440
I'll turn your desire into a dream come true.

00:14:53.440 --> 00:14:53.870
I'll turn your desire into a dream come true.

00:15:04.250 --> 00:15:05.450
Reina!

00:15:09.930 --> 00:15:12.920
Grant me your darkness!

00:15:24.640 --> 00:15:26.570
Say hello to Mammo Beast!

00:15:29.180 --> 00:15:30.640
That's a... rose?

00:15:30.640 --> 00:15:35.620
I see, roses have thorns that keep friends away. {There's a pun that's a bitch to translate here, so let's just go with something more poetic.}

00:15:36.090 --> 00:15:37.240
Let's go, everyone!

00:15:39.120 --> 00:15:40.790
Charles!

00:15:41.860 --> 00:15:44.720
Precure Love Link!

00:15:45.790 --> 00:15:46.480
L-O-V-E!

00:15:46.480 --> 00:15:47.140
L-O-V-E!

00:15:47.140 --> 00:15:47.910
L-O-V-E!

00:15:47.910 --> 00:15:49.030
L-O-V-E!

00:16:15.350 --> 00:16:16.790
Brimming with love,

00:16:17.530 --> 00:16:18.980
Cure Heart!

00:16:21.910 --> 00:16:23.370
The light of wisdom,

00:16:24.140 --> 00:16:25.560
Cure Diamond!

00:16:28.070 --> 00:16:29.820
The warmth of the sun,

00:16:30.660 --> 00:16:32.160
Cure Rosetta!

00:16:33.630 --> 00:16:34.960
The blade of courage,

00:16:35.830 --> 00:16:37.120
Cure Sword!

00:16:40.020 --> 00:16:42.220
Listen to the heartbeat of love!

00:16:42.820 --> 00:16:44.480
Dokidoki Precure!

00:16:46.190 --> 00:16:48.090
Oh poor rose who has lost her love,

00:16:48.900 --> 00:16:50.260
I, Cure Heart,

00:16:50.260 --> 00:16:53.410
will make your heart race once more!

00:16:54.220 --> 00:16:56.360
My heart doesn't need that!

00:17:00.630 --> 00:17:01.830
Oh no!

00:17:02.760 --> 00:17:05.000
This is how you keep friends away!

00:17:05.460 --> 00:17:07.780
With Heart and the fighters out of the way,

00:17:07.780 --> 00:17:10.710
the barrier user won't be any threat!

00:17:31.660 --> 00:17:33.990
W-Wait, since when could you do <i>that</i>?

00:17:33.990 --> 00:17:36.700
I swore an oath that day!

00:17:37.480 --> 00:17:43.130
I'd use the Precure's power to protect those I hold dear... my friends!

00:17:44.700 --> 00:17:46.340
Your <i>friends</i>?

00:17:47.000 --> 00:17:48.880
Who needs those?

00:17:50.640 --> 00:17:52.520
I do.

00:17:52.520 --> 00:17:56.850
Until I met Mana, I had no friends.

00:17:58.020 --> 00:18:01.050
I always wanted friends!

00:18:02.190 --> 00:18:07.670
That feeling made me rile up in anger when my friends were insulted.

00:18:07.670 --> 00:18:09.560
Cut the speech!

00:18:11.200 --> 00:18:15.420
But since I became a Precure with Mana,

00:18:15.420 --> 00:18:18.700
we've experienced so much together...

00:18:20.490 --> 00:18:23.650
that our bonds have grown even stronger!

00:18:24.190 --> 00:18:27.870
Because we trust each other more than ever,

00:18:28.910 --> 00:18:33.020
nobody else's words can ever shake my resolve!

00:18:33.530 --> 00:18:34.590
Alice!

00:18:35.090 --> 00:18:36.760
And what good is that?!

00:18:40.140 --> 00:18:44.810
Now that I've obtained true friendship, I'll no longer hesitate!

00:18:45.230 --> 00:18:48.040
If it's to protect my friends,

00:18:48.040 --> 00:18:50.880
I'll use every ounce of power I have!

00:18:53.500 --> 00:18:55.220
Love Heart Arrow!

00:19:02.590 --> 00:19:05.370
Precure Rosetta Reflection!

00:19:10.330 --> 00:19:12.400
What can you do with a barrier?

00:19:18.080 --> 00:19:19.340
Thanks, Rosetta!

00:19:24.960 --> 00:19:28.680
Precure Diamond Shower!

00:19:37.620 --> 00:19:40.640
Precure Sparkle Sword!

00:19:50.670 --> 00:19:53.800
Precure Heart Shoot!

00:20:18.410 --> 00:20:19.220
Huh?

00:20:19.220 --> 00:20:20.750
What was I...

00:20:22.460 --> 00:20:23.360
I'll remember this!

00:20:31.270 --> 00:20:32.100
Here.

00:20:34.220 --> 00:20:36.810
Can you find your queen with this?

00:20:37.360 --> 00:20:38.970
Not yet...

00:20:38.970 --> 00:20:43.010
But it was thanks to you that we got this rose.

00:20:43.010 --> 00:20:43.790
Thank you.

00:20:43.790 --> 00:20:45.460
Oh no...

00:20:45.460 --> 00:20:46.990
It was thanks to you all!

00:20:47.450 --> 00:20:49.760
I've never seen you get that serious.

00:20:49.760 --> 00:20:51.220
It was great!

00:20:52.440 --> 00:20:54.820
Makopi complimented Alice!

00:20:54.820 --> 00:20:57.430
She's never complimented us...

00:20:57.740 --> 00:21:00.800
You were cool out there, Alice.

00:21:00.800 --> 00:21:02.770
My heart was racing!

00:21:02.770 --> 00:21:05.860
The Precures are getting even stronger!

00:21:05.860 --> 00:21:07.410
That's good to hear!

00:21:20.220 --> 00:21:21.360
This is...

00:21:29.690 --> 00:21:31.020
Blasted Precures...

00:21:31.020 --> 00:21:33.280
Told ya so, Mammo.

00:21:34.460 --> 00:21:38.100
I think I'll take a break for some R&R.

00:21:39.350 --> 00:21:42.580
If you want a break, I'll be happy to oblige.

00:21:43.640 --> 00:21:46.550
Break your neck, that is.

00:21:47.600 --> 00:21:48.950
Who're you?

00:21:48.950 --> 00:21:49.950
A little princess?

00:21:50.490 --> 00:21:52.660
Why yes, I am.

00:21:52.990 --> 00:21:54.550
Who <i>are</i> you?

00:21:54.550 --> 00:21:55.430
Me?

00:21:55.970 --> 00:21:57.540
I'm Regina.

00:21:58.210 --> 00:22:00.290
King Selfish's daughter.

00:22:26.490 --> 00:22:27.890
<i>Dokidoki Precure</i>:

00:22:27.890 --> 00:22:31.530
A Dream or a Promise!

00:22:27.890 --> 00:22:31.530
A Dream or a Promise!

00:22:31.860 --> 00:22:33.960
That knot in your heart won't come undone!
